@RozetkaAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5224

### Реєстрація
POST {{RozetkaAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new.buyer@rozetka.test",
  "password": "Buyer12345",
  "firstName": "Марко",
  "lastName": "Шевчук",
  "phone": "+380671112233"
}

### Вхід
# @name login
POST {{RozetkaAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "buyer@rozetka.test",
  "password": "Buyer12345"
}

### Профіль
GET {{RozetkaAPI_HostAddress}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

###
